    {
      "title": "Problems, failure modes and limitations",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "NICE NG71 says not to offer olanzapine for PD psychosis, and the 2019 MDS review rated it not efficacious with unacceptable risk. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-11-27)",
          "source": "https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/ng71/chapter/recommendations",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:8e522ba0881768bcd8ae3f51b2f90fde482f3ac0858627742279de4e42e9d0a6",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:3f93107b2208d5c1b73b683cb866089dca482fb49dc16dd739f86f10b69faa33",
            "ev:430d287c30a0a56b9e044c5f1d05726eadad658d0ec0b4ed78b7cb703b74b3ec",
            "ev:6bb1f7e166689fc158f1b282767cb896437961e7a8ed4a4686cb0007dc3f15a0"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6916382/"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the six-week phase 3 pimavanserin trial, SAPS-PD improved more than with placebo without observed motor worsening; adverse-event discontinuations were more frequent with pimavanserin, so the trial does not establish risk-free treatment. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/24183563/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:061f669158cacc3acc9c5d6562cee0c31397f1e5c926eca4ecd2c80ff6e899c5",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:4a509753bf104f56651f0f8fe4d62e102606e85f19c403456e41a9f806b0170c",
            "ev:d58e054b90eaed4adc1ace03f25c1e2ebe7b784e8389676779649c71653548fd"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6916382/"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The 2024 German guideline recommends clinical history alongside screening scales: depression cannot be diagnosed from a score alone because PD and affective symptoms overlap. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11561078/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:0f07b39a5f829d84ac87698c8302f72e2e9948bcf464b7d10bb62104738d9ecd",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
